         StyleBox["\"\[FilledDiamond]\"", 13, 
          RGBColor[0., 0.45, 0.25], StripOnInput -> False], 
         "\"  into the numerator and the denominator of \"", 
         StyleBox["\"the given U-formula\"", Italic, 13, 
          RGBColor[0.85, 0.45, 0.], StripOnInput -> False], "\", we get\""},
        "RowDefault"],
       StripOnInput->False,
       FontSize->13]},
     {
      StyleBox["\<\"the numerator identity:\"\>",
       StripOnInput->False,
       FontSize->13]},
     {
