        "\"Verification: at each vertex, the sine and 1 - cos of the corner \
angle through the two half-angle cotangents give its half-cotangent as a \
quotient; Bricard's equation reduces the numerator to the radical of the \
parametrization by \"", 
         TagBox[
          SubscriptBox["\[Theta]", "1"], DisplayForm], 
         "\", which fixes the sign. Identities in the angles are checked as \
trigonometric identities, and each step between lines with the displayed \
quantities as symbols.\""},
        "RowDefault"],
       StripOnInput->False,
       FontSize->13,
       FontWeight->Bold]},
